          sa('A Ferris wheel rider\'s height is h(t) = 12 + 10sin(πt/15) m. Find every time in 0 ≤ t < 30 s when h = 17 m.', 't =', key='2.5 s and 12.5 s', note='Form required: both. sin(πt/15) = 1/2.'),
